      "_quality_rule": "KIMORE gives clinical scores, not correct/incorrect labels. A repetition is labelled 'correct' when the exercise's total clinical score >= correct_threshold * score_max. VERIFY score_max against the dataset documentation.",
      "score_max": 50,
      "correct_threshold": 0.7
    },
